% layout 'counter';
% title 'Counter.su';

<a href="/top100">Top-100</a><br/><br/>

Embed HTML-code to your web-site:<br/>
<br/>
<textarea cols="80" rows="6"><%== html_escape include 'include/code' %></textarea>

<br/><br/>

Counter Example:<br/>
%== include 'include/code';
<br/>

Another style of Counter (centered): <br/>
<textarea cols="80" rows="6"><%== html_escape include 'include/code', style => 'center' %></textarea>

<br/><br/>

Counter Example:<br/>
%== include 'include/code', style => 'center';
<br/>

